Context window: Can you keep sending unlimited conversation history?
Token usage: Does sending previous messages increase input token consumption?
Memory management: What happens when the conversation becomes very long?
Conversation reset: How do you clear the current session?
Persistence: Will your conversation history survive if you close and reopen the application?


